">350</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>480K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google（L5）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>190</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">190K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">190</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>220K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>200K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>50K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>320</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">320K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">320</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>470K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>adidas</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>140</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">140K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>170K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>50K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>25K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>175</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">175K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">175</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>245K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Under Armour</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>160K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>40K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>25K</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>160</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">160K–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span></span></span></span>225K</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"关键洞察\">关键洞察</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>Nike 的总包低于纯科技公司</strong>，但高于大多数消费品/运动品牌</li>\n<li><strong>股票占比较低</strong>，现金流更可预测</li>\n<li><strong>隐形福利有价值</strong>：40–50% 折扣 + 运动设施 + Campus 文化</li>\n<li><strong>生活成本优势</strong>：Beaverton 的住房成本远低于 Bay Area/NYC</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nike 的薪酬策略定位于&quot;消费品行业顶尖 + 科技行业中上游&quot;。它不试图在现金薪酬上与 FAANG 正面竞争，而是通过品牌文化认同、Campus 生活方式、员工折扣和相对合理的生活成本（Oregon 无销售税）来吸引那些&quot;想为一个有意义的品牌工作&quot;的人才。对于纯粹追求薪酬最大化的候选人，Nike 不是最优选择；但对于重视工作意义感和生活品质平衡的人，Nike 的综合 offer 竞争力不弱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nike 薪酬结构解析","id":"nike-薪酬结构解析"},{"level":2,"text":"总薪酬组成","id":"总薪酬组成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本工资（Base Salary）","id":"基本工资-base-salary"},{"level":3,"text":"2026 年公开薪资数据","id":"2026-年公开薪资数据"},{"level":3,"text":"地域差异","id":"地域差异"},{"level":3,"text":"薪资调整机制","id":"薪资调整机制"},{"level":2,"text":"RSU（Restricted Stock Units）","id":"rsu-restricted-stock-units"},{"level":3,"text":"授予机制","id":"授予机制"},{"level":3,"text":"Vesting 计划","id":"vesting-计划"},{"level":3,"text":"刷新授予（Refresh Grants）","id":"刷新授予-refresh-grants"},{"level":2,"text":"年终奖金（Annual Incentive Plan）","id":"年终奖金-annual-incentive-plan"},{"level":3,"text":"奖金结构","id":"奖金结构"},{"level":3,"text":"决定因素","id":"决定因素"},{"level":3,"text":"2025–2026 年的特殊情况","id":"2025-2026-年的特殊情况"},{"level":2,"text":"员工福利体系","id":"员工福利体系"},{"level":3,"text":"核心福利","id":"核心福利"},{"level":3,"text":"Nike Campus 特殊福利","id":"nike-campus-特殊福利"},{"level":3,"text":"运动员折扣的特殊说明","id":"运动员折扣的特殊说明"},{"level":2,"text":"总薪酬对比：Nike vs 科技公司 vs 其他品牌","id":"总薪酬对比-nike-vs-科技公司-vs-其他品牌"},{"level":3,"text":"Band IV / Senior IC 对比","id":"band-iv-senior-ic-对比"},{"level":3,"text":"关键洞察","id":"关键洞察"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nike 职级体系全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/nike/level-and-compensation/career-level-system"},"next":{"title":"Nike 绩效考核体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/nike/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation"}}